{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>Unto the Jabbok, unto the children of Ammon.</b> Jabbok is the name of the river, as it is said: ״ויעבור את מעבר יבק״. Just as Sihon took the land of Moab unto the land of Arnon, so he took the land of the children of Ammon unto the Jabbok, and the river separated between them. But from there onward, ״כי עז חזק גבול בני עמון״ — from the river onward, because the river marked the boundary."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:09:48.856619787Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}